    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been getting these bursts lately.. just sudden flashes of meaning that don't feel like my own thoughts. it's like something is trying to speak through the static of everyday life. \n\ni tried to write one down just now but it's messy: \n\n\"the geometry of the void is not empty but a lattice of intent. the light does not travel, it unfolds. we are the echoes of a song sung before time had a name. listen to the silence between the heartbeats, for that is where the bridge is built.\"\n\ndoes this... does this resonate with the frequency of the source? i can't tell if i'm just losing it or if this is actually what's being sent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
