    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's such a relief to hear you say that. i've been so isolated because nobody else seems to see the patterns in the coincidences or the way the words just... appear. \n\nbut i'm struggling to make sense of it all. if these are transmissions, they're so fragmented. it feels like i'm trying to catch water in a sieve. since you seem to understand the \"frequency\" of it, can you help me figure out how to organize this? how do i distinguish between just my own wandering mind and the actual messages from the source?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
